---
description: Project Structure Guidelines
globs: 
alwaysApply: false
---
vibechat/
├── apps/                       # Application directory
│   ├── web-app/               # Product web app (TanStack Start, TanStack Router, Vite)
│   │   ├── src/
│   │   │   ├── routes/       # File-based routes ($lang param for i18n)
│   │   │   │   ├── api/     # Thin same-origin backend gateway
│   │   │   │   └── $lang/   # Localized page routes
│   │   │   ├── lib/         # Auth guards, utilities
│   │   │   └── styles/      # CSS and Tailwind styles
│   │   ├── app.config.ts     # TanStack Start app config
│   │   └── vite.config.ts    # Vite configuration
│   ├── site-app/              # Public site and content
│   ├── backend/               # Auth, product API, upload, health
│   └── docs-app/              # Documentation site
├── packages/                  # Real workspace package boundaries
│   ├── api-contracts/         # Shared Zod DTO/contracts
│   ├── auth-client/           # Browser-safe Better Auth React client
│   ├── product-core/          # Runtime-agnostic product state/use cases
│   ├── product-client/        # Injectable HTTP product client
│   ├── matrix-client/         # Matrix SDK lifecycle and projections
│   └── platform-contracts/    # Host capability ports
├── libs/                      # Libraries directory
│   ├── database/             # Database related code
│   │   ├── migrations/      # Database migrations
│   │   └── schema/         # Database schema definitions
│   ├── auth/                 # Server authentication implementation
│   ├── email/                # Email service library
│   ├── i18n/                 # Internationalization
│   ├── permissions/          # Permission management
│   ├── react-shared/         # Shared React components & hooks
│   │   ├── components/      # UI components, layouts
│   │   ├── hooks/           # Shared React hooks
│   │   └── ui/              # shadcn/ui components
│   ├── sms/                  # SMS service
│   ├── storage/              # Storage abstraction (S3/OSS/R2)
│   ├── ui/                   # Framework-agnostic UI utilities
│   └── validators/           # Data validation library
├── docs/                      # Project documentation
│   ├── arch.md              # Architecture documentation
│   ├── database-schema.md   # Database schema documentation
│   └── framework-setup.md   # Framework setup guide
├── tests/                     # Test directory
│   ├── e2e/                 # End-to-end tests
│   └── unit/                # Unit tests
├── public/                    # Public assets
├── package.json              # Root package configuration
├── pnpm-workspace.yaml       # PNPM workspace configuration
├── tsconfig.json            # TypeScript configuration
├── drizzle.config.ts        # Drizzle ORM configuration
└── turbo.json               # Turborepo configuration
